msgctxt "Status:4158:0:1"
msgid "Cursed by everlasting light. Close proximity to the player to whom you are bound will result in unaspected damage to those nearby."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 重光の兆し
#. de: Gleißendes Omen
#. fr: Présage de Lumière intense
