msgid "Invigorated by the thrill of battle and commanding pack spirits to aid in combat."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 死出の暗闇
#. de: Finsternis des Todes
#. fr: Noirceur de l'au-delà
#. column 1: Death prowls ever closer, resulting in KO when this effect expires. Effect removed upon taking Light-aspected damage.
msgctxt "Status:4518:0:0"
msgid "Shadow of Death"
msgstr ""

