msgctxt "Status:4651:0:0"
msgid "Ash Kinship"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 死屍綱の本能を一時的に借りた状態。効果中は「アッシュクレンズ」を実行できる。
#. de: Borgt sich vor<shy>über<shy>gehend den Äther eines Todlings. Erlaubt die Ausführung von <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Läuternde Asche</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.
#. fr: A emprunté l'éther d'une bête nécroïde. Cendres purifiantes peuvent être lancées.
#. column 0: Ash Kinship
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Status:4651:0:1"
msgid "Borrowing aether from an ashkin familiar. Able to execute <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Scouring Ash</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 猛毒
#. de: Giftlache
#. fr: Poison violent
#. column 1: Toxins are causing damage over time.
msgctxt "Status:4652:0:0"
msgid "Toxicosis"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 毒に冒された状態。ＨＰが徐々に失われる。
#. de: Erleidet schrittweise Schaden durch Gift.
#. fr: Des dégâts périodiques de poison sont subis.
#. column 0: Toxicosis
msgctxt "Status:4652:0:1"
msgid "Toxins are causing damage over time."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 死の宣告
#. de: Verhängnis
#. fr: Glas
#. column 1: Certain death when counter reaches zero.
msgctxt "Status:4683:0:0"
msgid "Doom"
msgstr ""

#. ja: カウント0で戦闘不能に陥る状態。
#. de: Wird kampfunfähig, sobald der Timer auf 0 sinkt.
#. fr: Mort certaine lorsque le compteur atteint zéro.
#. column 0: Doom
msgctxt "Status:4683:0:1"
msgid "Certain death when counter reaches zero."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 変身
#. de: Ver<shy>wand<shy>lung
#. fr: Transformation
#. column 1: Corporeal form has been altered.
msgctxt "Status:4708:0:0"
msgid "Transfiguration"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 別の姿に変身した状態。
#. de: Die körperliche Erscheinung ist verändert.
#. fr: L'apparence est com<shy>plè<shy>te<shy>ment changée.
#. column 0: Transfiguration
msgctxt "Status:4708:0:1"
msgid "Corporeal form has been altered."
msgstr ""

#. ja: スーパースプリント
#. de: Supersprint
#. fr: Super sprint
#. column 1: Movement speed is greatly increased.
msgctxt "Status:4709:0:0"
msgid "Swift Sprint"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 移動速度が大幅に上昇した状態。
#. de: Be<shy>we<shy>gungs<shy>ge<shy>schwin<shy>dig<shy>keit ist stark erhöht.
#. fr: La vitesse de déplacement est grandement augmentée.
#. column 0: Swift Sprint
msgctxt "Status:4709:0:1"
msgid "Movement speed is greatly increased."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 最大ＨＰアップ
#. de: LP-Bonus
#. fr: Bonus de PV
#. column 1: Maximum HP is increased.
msgctxt "Status:4710:0:0"
msgid "HP Boost"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 最大ＨＰが増加した状態。
#. de: Maximal-LP sind erhöht.
#. fr: Les PV maximums sont augmentés.
#. column 0: HP Boost
msgctxt "Status:4710:0:1"
msgid "Maximum HP is increased."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ヘイスト
#. de: Hast
#. fr: Hâte
#. column 1: Weaponskill cast time and recast time, spell cast time and recast time, and auto-attack delay are reduced.
msgctxt "Status:4718:0:0"
msgid "Haste"
msgstr ""

#. ja: オートアタックの攻撃間隔と、ウェポンスキルおよび魔法のキャストタイムとリキャストタイムが短縮された状態。
#. de: Die Intervalle zwischen Auto-Attacken und die (Re-)Ak<shy>ti<shy>vie<shy>rungs<shy>zei<shy>ten von Waf<shy>fen<shy>fer<shy>tig<shy>kei<shy>ten und Magie sind verkürzt.
#. fr: La vitesse des attaques automatiques est augmentée, et les temps de lancement et de recharge des sorts et des techniques d'arme sont réduits.
#. column 0: Haste
msgctxt "Status:4718:0:1"
msgid "Weaponskill cast time and recast time, spell cast time and recast time, and auto-attack delay are reduced."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ターゲッティング：重雷
#. de: Supraleitendes Ziel
#. fr: Portée de plasma hyperconducteur
#. column 1: Found to be a suitable conductor. Certain attacks will also result in a burst of plasma.
msgctxt "Status:4719:0:0"
msgid "Designated Conductor"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 標的となっている状態。特定アクションと同時に重雷が発動する。
#. de: Ins Visier genommen. Bei einer bestimmten Attacke wird <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Supraleitendes Plasma</ui-edge-color></ui-color> ausgelöst.
#. fr: Cible conductrice. Une attaque de plasma hyperconducteur est subie après une certaine attaque.
#. column 0: Designated Conductor
msgctxt "Status:4719:0:1"
msgid "Found to be a suitable conductor. Certain attacks will also result in a burst of plasma."
msgstr ""

#. ja: オーバーブースト
#. de: Toter Übertakt
#. fr: Surcharge turbo
#. column 1: Aetherial amplification is increasing the power of certain attacks.
msgctxt "Status:4720:0:0"
msgid "Dead Man's Overdraught"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 魔力の増幅により、一部のアクションを強化した状態。
#. de: Einige Attacken sind magisch verstärkt.
#. fr: Une quantité plus élevée d'énergie éthérée augmente la puissance de certaines actions.
#. column 0: Dead Man's Overdraught
msgctxt "Status:4720:0:1"
msgid "Aetherial amplification is increasing the power of certain attacks."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 怪樹の実
#. de: Unheimliche Frucht
#. fr: Fruit de morbol
#. column 1: Queasy from eating morbol fruit. Unable to consume more until effect expires.
msgctxt "Status:4722:0:0"
msgid "Morbid Meal"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 怪樹の実を食べた状態。効果時間中は怪樹の実を食べられない。
#. de: Hat von einer unheimlichen Frucht gekostet. Bis Ende des Effekts kann keine weitere Frucht gegessen werden.
#. fr: A mangé un fruit de morbol. Ne peut pas en manger pendant la durée de l'effet.
#. column 0: Morbid Meal
msgctxt "Status:4722:0:1"
msgid "Queasy from eating morbol fruit. Unable to consume more until effect expires."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 妖精王の加護
#. de: Segen des Feenkönigs
#. fr: Protection du Monarque
#. column 1: Warded by the pixie king and invulnerable to all damage.
msgctxt "Status:4723:0:0"
msgid "Sapling's Crown"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 妖精王の加護を受けた状態。一時的に無敵になる。
#. de: Erleidet vor<shy>über<shy>gehend keinen Schaden.
#. fr: Invulnérable temporairement grâce à la protection du Monarque féérique.
#. column 0: Sapling's Crown
msgctxt "Status:4723:0:1"
msgid "Warded by the pixie king and invulnerable to all damage."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 水の鎖［近］
#. de: Fluide Ketten (nah)
#. fr: Chaînes aqueuses proches
#. column 1: Chained to an ally. Drawing too near to this partner will result in increased damage taken.
msgctxt "Status:4724:0:0"
msgid "Near Shore Shackles"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 水の鎖で繋がれた仲間に近づくと、被害が増大する状態。
#. de: Erleidet bei Annäherung an einen durch Fluide Ketten verbundenen Mitstreiter erhöhten Schaden.
#. fr: Se rapprocher de l'autre victime reliée par ces chaînes provoque une grosse explosion.
#. column 0: Near Shore Shackles
msgctxt "Status:4724:0:1"
msgid "Chained to an ally. Drawing too near to this partner will result in increased damage taken."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 水の鎖［遠］
#. de: Fluide Ketten (fern)
#. fr: Chaînes aqueuses éloignées
#. column 1: Chained to an ally. Drawing too far from this partner will result in increased damage taken.
msgctxt "Status:4725:0:0"
msgid "Far Shore Shackles"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 水の鎖で繋がれた仲間から離れると、被害が増大する状態。
#. de: Erleidet bei Entfernung von einem durch Fluide Ketten verbundenen Mitstreiter erhöhten Schaden.
#. fr: S'éloigner l'autre victime reliée par ces chaînes provoque une grosse explosion.
#. column 0: Far Shore Shackles
msgctxt "Status:4725:0:1"
msgid "Chained to an ally. Drawing too far from this partner will result in increased damage taken."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ターゲッティング：バーストフラッド
#. de: Ziel von Wassersturm
#. fr: Cible de déferlement soudain
#. column 1: Designated target of Tidalspout, which will activate when this effect expires.
msgctxt "Status:4726:0:0"
msgid "Tidalspout Target"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 標的となっている状態。効果時間終了時に、バーストフラッドが発動する。
#. de: Ins Visier genommen. Bei Ende dieses Effekts wird <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Wassersturm</ui-edge-color></ui-color> ausgelöst.
#. fr: Déferlement soudain est retardé et sera lancé sur cette cible à la fin de cet effet.
#. column 0: Tidalspout Target
msgctxt "Status:4726:0:1"
msgid "Designated target of Tidalspout, which will activate when this effect expires."
msgstr ""

#. ja: エーテル増強
#. de: Ätherrausch
#. fr: Éther amplifié
#. column 1: Empowered by aether drained from the not-so-innocent.
msgctxt "Status:4727:0:0"
msgid "Satisfied"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 他者からエーテルを奪い取り、強力な力を得た状態。
#. de: Die eigene Stärke wird durch gestohlenen Äther erhöht.
#. fr: La puissance est augmentée après avoir dérobé de l'éther vital.
#. column 0: Satisfied
msgctxt "Status:4727:0:1"
msgid "Empowered by aether drained from the not-so-innocent."
msgstr ""

#. ja: エーテル超増強
#. de: Fataler Ätherrausch
#. fr: Éther décuplé
#. column 1: Greatly empowered by aether drained, perhaps in excess, from the not-so-innocent.
msgctxt "Status:4728:0:0"
msgid "More than Satisfied"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 他者から大量のエーテルを奪い取り、超強力な力を得た状態。
#. de: Die eigene Stärke wird durch eine gewaltige Menge an gestohlenem Äther maximal erhöht.
#. fr: La puissance est très fortement augmentée après avoir dérobé une grande quantité d'éther vital.
#. column 0: More than Satisfied
msgctxt "Status:4728:0:1"
msgid "Greatly empowered by aether drained, perhaps in excess, from the not-so-innocent."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ボムバット
#. de: Fledermausbombe
#. fr: Bombe ailée
#. column 1: Being fed upon by a vampette bat, which will explode in response to certain attacks.
msgctxt "Status:4729:0:0"
msgid "Curse of the Bombpyre"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 特定の攻撃に反応して爆発するコウモリに取り付かれた状態。
#. de: Von einer Fledermaus verfolgt, die bei Kontakt mit einem bestimmten Angriff explodiert.
#. fr: Suite à une certaine attaque, une chauve-souris explosive est attachée sur le corps.
#. column 0: Curse of the Bombpyre
msgctxt "Status:4729:0:1"
msgid "Being fed upon by a vampette bat, which will explode in response to certain attacks."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ヘル・イン・ア・セル後遺症
#. de: Höllenkäfig-Nachwirkungen
#. fr: Enfer carcéral<nbsp>: séquelles
#. column 1: Wounded by contact with a charnel cell. Taking damage from the same attack again will result in instant death.
msgctxt "Status:4730:0:0"
msgid "Hell Awaits"
msgstr ""

#. ja: セル・ファタールに触れた際の傷痕が残る状態。再度同じ攻撃を受けると、即座に戦闘不能状態になる。
#. de: Hat Wunden durch Kontakt mir einer fatalen Zelle erlitten und wird kampfunfähig, wenn derselbe Angriff erneut erlitten wird.
#. fr: Des cicatrices ap<shy>pa<shy>rais<shy>sent après avoir touché la geôle fatale. L'effet rend inconscient si une même attaque frappe deux fois.
#. column 0: Hell Awaits
msgctxt "Status:4730:0:1"
msgid "Wounded by contact with a charnel cell. Taking damage from the same attack again will result in instant death."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ヘル・イン・ア・セル強制
#. de: Höllenkäfig-Zwang
#. fr: Enfer carcéral<nbsp>: sentence
#. column 1: Trapped in a mortal struggle. Will be freed upon destruction of the charnel cell.
msgctxt "Status:4731:0:0"
msgid "Hell in a Cell"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 対戦を強制されている状態。セル・ファタールを破壊すると解除される。
#. de: Zum Einzelduell auserwählt. Wird durch Zerstörung einer fatalen Zelle aufgehoben.
#. fr: Une cible spécifique a été imposée. Détruire la geôle fatale dissipe l'effet.
#. column 0: Hell in a Cell
msgctxt "Status:4731:0:1"
msgid "Trapped in a mortal struggle. Will be freed upon destruction of the charnel cell."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ヘル・イン・ア・セル強制
